      "label": "Drain of Wealth Theory",
      "children": [
        {
          "label": "Core Concept & Proponents",
          "children": [
            { "label": "First articulated comprehensively by Dadabhai Naoroji in 'Poverty and Un‑British Rule in India' (1901).\nHe calculated the drain at approximately £30 million per year." },
