          "label": "Independence & Partition",
          "children": [
            { "label": "Indian Independence Act (18 July 1947): Legalised the June 3 Plan, creating two independent dominions, India and Pakistan, from 15 August 1947.\nAbolished the office of Viceroy and the Secretary of State." },
