                "label": "Viceroy (Lord Canning first); direct representative of Crown; ended Double Government of Pitt's India Act by abolishing Board of Control and Court of Directors",
                "kind": "bullet"
              },
              {
                "label": "TRAP: Did NOT alter the highly centralized system of government in India in any substantial way; administrative structure remained unchanged",
                "kind": "trap"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "Indian Councils Act 1861",
            "kind": "subsection",
            "children": [
