      "answer": "C",
      "difficulty": "mid"
    },
    {
      "id": "tribal-025",
      "q": "Consider the following regarding the ADC elections: 1. Elections are held on the basis of adult franchise. 2. They are conducted by the Election Commission of India. Which of the above is/are correct?",
      "options": {
        "A": "1 only",
        "B": "2 only",
        "C": "Both 1 and 2",
        "D": "Neither 1 nor 2"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "difficulty": "hard"
    },
    {
      "id": "tribal-026",
      "q": "The Sixth Schedule was added to the Constitution to:",
