      "q": "Consider the following statements regarding Article 365 of the Constitution: 1. It acts as the constitutional trigger for the imposition of President’s Rule under Article 356. 2. It applies when a state fails to comply with or give effect to any direction given by the Union in the exercise of its executive power. 3. Deciding to apply Article 365 is a constitutional discretion of the President. How many of the above statements are correct?",
