    {
      "id": "citizen-final-003",
      "q": "Consider the following statements regarding an Overseas Citizen of India (OCI) cardholder: 1. An OCI cardholder has the constitutional right to register as a voter in India. 2. An OCI cardholder is permitted to purchase agricultural land and plantation properties in India without RBI permission. 3. An OCI cardholder is exempt from registration with the Foreign Regional Registration Officer (FRRO) for any length of stay in India. How many of the above statements are correct?",
