      "q": "Consider the following statements regarding the composition of the Supreme Court: 1. The Constitution originally provided for a Chief Justice and 7 other judges. 2. Parliament can increase the number of judges by law. 3. Currently the Supreme Court consists of the Chief Justice of India and 33 other judges. Which of the above is/are correct?",
